      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Provider**\n\nI'm solidifying the initial architecture of `profile_claims.py`. I've decided to anchor the external provider to Auth0. The next step is to write a function that will...\n\n\n**Creating the File**\n\nI've established the foundation by creating the `profile_claims.py` file, and I'm solidifying the architecture around it. I'm focusing on Auth0 as the external identity provider for the federated claims, and I'll be using `requests` to call the user info endpoint. I plan to incorporate identifiable signals like the Auth0 domain and client ID.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860398088,
          "start": 1789860396203
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbfe3caa001RoM0x7CU1SLLvA",
